DATA. The code licence above does not cover the data files.

data/external/fig2e.csv is from Murphy AC, Muldoon SF, Baker D, Lastowka A,
Bennett B, Yang M, Bassett DS, "Structure, function, and control of the
musculoskeletal network - Data", Zenodo, doi:10.5281/zenodo.1069104, released
under CC BY-SA 4.0. It is redistributed here under that licence.

The three files derived from it, data/derived/muscle_degree_counts.csv,
data/derived/musculoskeletal_coupling_shares.csv and
data/derived/musculoskeletal_random_null_shares.csv, carry CC BY-SA 4.0 for the
same reason.

The remaining files in data/derived/ are released under CC BY 4.0.

cov_MOTOR, from github.com/NicholasJWeaver/BrainCompressibility2025, is not
redistributed here because that repository declares no licence. Obtain it with
data/external/fetch_external.py.
